# The build context, trimmed.
#
# node_modules is the one that matters: the dashboard stage runs `npm ci` from
# the lockfile, so shipping a local install into the context would copy tens of
# thousands of files to gain nothing - and a Windows or macOS install would
# carry the wrong native binaries into a Linux build.

# Dependencies - reinstalled from the lockfile inside the image.
web/node_modules/
node_modules/

# Build output - produced inside the image.
bin/
dist/
internal/ui/dist/
web/.vite/

# Version control and local tooling.
.git/
.github/
.claude/

# Local state and secrets. These must never reach a build context.
*.key
master.key
config.yaml
config.local.yaml
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Working notes and reports.
STATE.md
docs/superpowers/
reports/
*.report.json
*.report.html

# Editors / OS.
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
